1
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:24,989
White tiles cool against my skin.

2
00:00:26,859 --> 00:00:32,369
Chlorine hanging in the air.

3
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:37,579
A quiet clock upon the wall.

4
00:00:38,399 --> 00:00:43,659
My fortress built without a care.

5
00:00:46,299 --> 00:00:50,000
The paso doble strikes the dark!

6
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:54,500
My scarlet dress a cape of fire.

7
00:00:54,649 --> 00:00:58,409
Stamping heels upon the wood.

8
00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:05,090
An arena fueled by raw desire!

9
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:13,000
Ice-cold water from the tap.

10
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:17,000
Linoleum and quiet shade.

11
00:01:17,299 --> 00:01:20,719
No echoes here, no open doors.

12
00:01:21,129 --> 00:01:26,209
Behind the sanctuary I made.

13
00:01:26,319 --> 00:01:30,120
A proud matador, a burning pulse!

14
00:01:30,379 --> 00:01:34,379
Eyes locked tight, an arching spine.

15
00:01:34,530 --> 00:01:38,260
Amber spotlights, chest to chest.

16
00:01:38,459 --> 00:01:48,370
Your heartbeat racing into mine!

17
00:01:49,430 --> 00:01:53,000
Kohl-black marks around my eyes.

18
00:01:53,659 --> 00:01:57,319
Bitter tea inside my cup.

19
00:01:57,400 --> 00:02:01,230
A safe haven, locked away.

20
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:06,250
No outer world can break it up.

21
00:02:06,459 --> 00:02:10,159
Paso doble, sharp and fierce!

22
00:02:10,340 --> 00:02:14,539
Blood-red satin splits the night.

23
00:02:14,689 --> 00:02:18,219
Pride and passion, wild and free.

24
00:02:18,349 --> 00:02:28,990
We rule the ring in golden light!

25
00:02:45,370 --> 00:02:49,569
Back to the quiet, back to bleach.

26
00:02:50,199 --> 00:02:55,000
The echo fades into the wall.

27
00:02:55,199 --> 00:03:00,500
A sleeping queen inside her fort.

28
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:05,000
Until the trumpets call.